-- Productivity Workshop - Book Giveaway (GT 38686, key ysax8cl)
-- Overcoming Procrastination workshop, Nov 24 2026: three draws for a signed copy of 12 Levers.
-- Share one link per round in the Zoom chat:
--   https://www.guidedtrack.com/programs/ysax8cl/run?round=1   (then round=2, round=3)
-- The URL parameter sets `round`; a link without it saves giveawayRound = "none".
-- Winners are drawn with workshop_giveaway_draw.py (one copy per person).

*if: not round
	>> round = "none"
>> giveawayRound = round

*page
	*header: Win a signed copy of 12 Levers
	*if: not (round = "none")
		This is giveaway {round} of 3 in today's workshop. Enter below and we'll announce the winner live in a few minutes.
	*if: round = "none"
		Enter below and we'll announce the winner live in a few minutes.

	*question: What nickname should we announce if you win?
		*type: text
		*save: nickname

	*question: What's your email?
		*type: text
		*save: email

*header: You're in!
*if: not (round = "none")
	You're entered in giveaway {round} of 3. Stay on the call: we'll read out the winner's nickname shortly, and we'll email the winner to get a mailing address.
*if: round = "none"
	You're entered. Stay on the call: we'll read out the winner's nickname shortly, and we'll email the winner to get a mailing address.

You can enter each of the three giveaways (each has its own link in the chat). Each person can win one copy at most.
